23
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:16,590
اجلسي

24
00:03:16,930 --> 00:03:18,930
اخبريني بطلبك

25
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:36,750
I continued to wait, secretly holding my breath

26
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:41,280
While simply clawing at my heart

27
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:52,630
One minute and one second
had never felt this long

28
